  "captions": [
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-0-z63wqm",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-0-z63wqm",
      "text": "# 海岸线为什么在后退\n\n",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durationFrames": 82
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-d-108r2j1",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-d-108r2j1",
      "text": "清晨的潮水退去以后，沙滩上会留下一条细线。海岸线看起来固定，其实每天都在移动。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 82,
      "durationFrames": 335
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-1i-15rcyoi",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-1i-15rcyoi",
      "text": "过去三十年，这段海岸平均每年后退一米。三十年加在一起，就是三十米。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 417,
      "durationFrames": 281
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-2h-1q5q1ok",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-2h-1q5q1ok",
      "text": "先看潮汐之前的礁石。礁石还在，它前面的沙洲已经变窄。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 698,
      "durationFrames": 226
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-39-q59mm6",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-39-q59mm6",
      "text": "海浪不断带走泥沙，河流送来的泥沙又越来越少，海岸就失去了补充。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 924,
      "durationFrames": 263
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-46-ar39m0",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-46-ar39m0",
      "text": "同一条海岸小径上，树根裸露的位置也发生了变化。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 1187,
      "durationFrames": 199
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-4v-1nd2t3i",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-4v-1nd2t3i",
      "text": "一次强风暴带走的沙子，可能相当于平常几年的侵蚀。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 1386,
      "durationFrames": 208
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-5l-1i9qb0f",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-5l-1i9qb0f",
      "text": "不过，涌浪也会把新的泥沙推回岸边，形成短暂的恢复。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 1594,
      "durationFrames": 209
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-6c-4dbs0p",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-6c-4dbs0p",
      "text": "真正重要的是长期趋势。单次测量很容易被潮汐和天气误导。\n\n",
      "startFrame": 1803,
      "durationFrames": 244
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-segment-75-18n2i9u",
      "scriptSegmentId": "segment-75-18n2i9u",
      "text": "这段视频使用本地图片、视频和合成语音，验证导演计划、媒体层、字幕和连续形变。\n\n",
